#: ../../general/Ms_description/ecom.rst:84
msgid "``mail-inbox-sd``"
msgstr "``mail-inbox-sd``"

#: ../../general/Ms_description/ecom.rst:85
msgid "Ящик для создания заявок Service Desk и получения ответов по ним."
msgstr ""
"Mailbox for creating Service Desk tickets and receiving replies to them."

